.nh
.TH runc-state "8"

.SH "نام (NAME)"
\fBrunc-state\fP \- show the state of a container


.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBrunc state\fP \fIcontainer-id\fP


.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
The \fBstate\fP command outputs current state information for the specified
\fIcontainer-id\fP in a JSON format.


.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
\fBrunc\fP(8).
